  "title": "Italian Olive Oil Cake",
  "description": "This simple olive oil cake from Chef John is moist, not too sweet, with a delicious hint of orange. It might be the easiest cake you&#39;ve ever made!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-09-16T09:00:00-04:00",
