  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 teaspoons kosher salt",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "3 large eggs",
    "1.75 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup extra-virgin olive oil, plus more for greasing",
    "1 cup whole milk",
    "1 tablespoon honey",
    "2 tablespoons freshly grated orange zest (2 oranges)",
    "1 tablespoon powdered sugar for dusting"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-cwRAGgSGBZcusWLm9TX0CzmAvs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-ingredients-04764ebc7aae45b78aa9b22f29105d5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom of a springform pan with a round piece of parchment paper and generously grease with olive oil. Grease the sides of the pan with olive oil as well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6AbVW1z5MMMRLT_ucDgFOrFF_AM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-step-02-ac551ae09d43445c95436326e7cba1f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, salt, baking powder, and baking soda in a bowl; whisk together until evenly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3wXfOWsIP49HnGvovcisFkGG8JU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-step-03-1-6f77f2b20a2c4ec792bdbc2a5cde1d6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine eggs, sugar, olive oil, milk, honey, and orange zest in a second bowl. Starting slowly at first, whisk together until mixture is smooth. Stir in flour mixture until everything is just mixed together and flour has disappeared. Do not overmix.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bxkHBOLAdjNRu5NiZxFAY7Yxk5o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-step-05-2-d528e903da7a4dce908b752c82c01a49.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared pan and tap pan a few times against the work surface to remove any air bubbles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-Sb7iDBi5mWdqC-DezskZ2e-94U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-step-06-169f5aebb382416cb70eb1f1c1fa564a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the cake is browned on the surface and a wooden skewer inserted into the center of the cake comes out clean, 60 to 70 minutes. Make sure to not overbake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X_0awWio0oVqUqFXLTF8fsITda4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-step-07-3a371df85c2b48fa996fa875f990c6ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer cake to a wire rack and allow to cool for 30 minutes. Loosen edge of the cake by running a knife around the sides of the pan. Remove from the pan and allow to cool completely, another 30 minutes. Dust with powdered sugar if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MYXmm-T3pQYKALgxgQ_l_-NH3uM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-step-08-e78370be6773430bada479e609b59e40.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hu9QZM8aY_66ip7saDxykGpAoqs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8476327-italian-olive-oil-cake-VAT-4x3-1-20866f727bf446d591956df9239851b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8476327/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
